  "details": "I made a post already, but for some reason it disappeared.\nAnyway, basically the current build on Viveport apparently has not gone through basic QA because:\n1. UI Render order is back to front (ie. avatars render behind the UI instead of in front of)\n2. Mirrors are fundamentally broken.\n3. UI/Udon Events are not working on some maps, and some newer VRChat just don't load at all (crash). \n4. VRChat is memory leaking; I'm getting frequent \"out of memory\" errors.\n\nI don't have videos for them all, but I have some screenshots.\n\nYes, I've tried uninstalling and reinstalling.",
